untime campaigns and machine-code, compiler, runtime or physical-resource assurance are outside the requested endpoint. The requested assurance boundary is normative restricted-source execution, with natural-language correspondence, host tooling, the pinned Lean kernel, hashing and OS/hardware explicitly trusted."}],"invariants":[],"liveness_properties":[],"postconditions":[{"acceptance_criteria":["For all integer n,m,a,b satisfying A1, the actual solve result equals Σ_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m).","For every summand, floor division satisfies q*m <= a*i+b < (q+1)*m; truncation toward zero is insufficient.","Every input with n=0 returns 0.","solve({a:-2,b:1,m:3,n:4}) returns -4; solve({a:100,b:-99,m:7,n:0}) returns 0.","The formal contract binds file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and each of typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only.","Universal source implementation refinement is required; examples, result existence or reflexive equalities cannot replace it."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"id":"O1","kind":"postcondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-004:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriS